    "body": "I'm not recommending that approach. I'm saying that if you want to navigate you should navigate and not expect that `fetch()` navigates. It just does a request. The `formdata` event might be what you're looking for, but I'm not sure where browser support is at.\r\n\r\nTo be clear though, this is a place to discuss issues with the Fetch standard. Questions such as these are best posed on StackOverflow or equivalent forum.",
